WEBVTT

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.980
An all-you-can-eat cake buffet?!

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:09.360
Y-Yeah, I heard a new place 
opened up by the station.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.580
Sakurada-san asked if you'd like to join us.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:15.110
Well, actually...

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.300
I'd love to go with you guys,

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.950
but I'm not sure about eating, 
considering my fangs and all.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.000
So, well... Sorry, but...

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:03.010
<b>Let's Be Honest!</b>

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:02.220
Let's Be Honest!

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:05.020
<b>Acorn Tree</b>

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:10.580
Is this Heaven?

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.640
I'm glad it makes you happy.

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:16.240
I can really have anything I want?

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:17.860
That's right.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.800
<i>I'm glad.</i>

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.480
<i>Protecting her secret is important, too,</i>

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:27.900
<i>but I hope we'll be able to spend more 
time like this together with our friends.</i>

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.750
You're not from around here, 
right, Shiragami-san?

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:35.000
And you live alone, don't you?

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.690
Let's eat while we talk.

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:44.260
Isn't it tough living by yourself?

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:48.160
Well, it was at first, sure,

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:50.430
but it's been almost a year and a half now.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.320
<i>Huh, she seems totally fine.</i>

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.430
<i>Actually, eating while we talk</i>

00:02:57.430 --> 00:03:00.400
<i>makes hiding her mouth look natural.</i>

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.870
This is delicious.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:04.740
Which one?

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.200
Here, the one on top of—

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:07.910
Shiragami!

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.250
Wh-What's wrong, Kuromine-kun?

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.610
Huh? What's up?

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:14.720
Dude, Asahi, don't just shout out of nowhere.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:15.750
That scared me.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.740
S-Sorry, it's nothing.

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.760
Yeah, well... It's okay, but...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.450
<i>Shiragami doesn't realize it?</i>

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:26.510
<i>Fortunately, it looks like 
they can't see them, but...</i>

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:30.350
So, when did you guys meet Kuromine-kun?

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.490
I met him in our first year of high school.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:35.390
First year of middle school for me.

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:36.160
Wow.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:40.690
You've known Akemi-san for a while too, then.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:39.790
An email?

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:44.000
Yeah, since she and Asahi were friends as kids.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:42.200
<i>From Shima?</i>

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.950
<i>He's right here. Why is he messaging me?</i>

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:49.080
<i>C-Can he see her wings from where he is?</i>

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.250
<b>Inbox</b>

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.250
<b>From: Shimada
Subject: Got a minute?
The waitresses here have
super short skirts, huh?</b>

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:57.040
<i>Shima...</i>

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.120
<i>Why'd you bother emailing me for that?</i>

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:00.500
<i>I worried for nothing...</i>

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.690
<i>Oh, right. My phone.</i>

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:04.970
<i>No one will notice if I use my phone.</i>

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:06.240
Shiragami.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:10.060
Hey, Asahi! Don't show 
Shiragami-san my email!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.060
To: <Enter recipient>
Subject: <Enter subject>
Shiragami, your wings are out!

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:13.830
Really? Was it that shocking?

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.370
<i>Sorry, Shima.</i>

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:17.900
<i>And thanks.</i>

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:21.130
It looks like I hurt you, so...

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.780
I'll give you this necklace to make up for it.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.720
<i>A c-cross!</i>

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:28.700
<i>No! When Shiragami sees crosses, she...</i>

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:31.620
I'm sorry. Of course you don't want this.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:35.250
No, I didn't mean it that way... Um...

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.250
<i>Oh, yeah. She just gets a bit angry.</i>

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.960
H-Honest, I really didn't mean it.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.760
Th-The sun's so bright today!

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.520
What's gotten into you?

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:46.480
When is Asahi ever <i>not</i> acting weird?

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:47.140
Ouch!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.870
<i>I-It's one thing after another...</i>

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.390
What the heck?!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.030
You guys again?

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:54.640
It's the pool all over again.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.240
<i>Mikan's here?!</i>

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.390
Look, Mikan!

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:58.770
What, Asahi?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.650
Hey, you look good, Mikan-chan.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.000
Oka-kun, you came here knowing 
I was here, didn't you?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:08.270
Wait, what? You're here too, Shiragami-san?

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.580
Aren't you working?

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.940
If you mess with Shiragami...

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:12.750
I won't.

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:16.620
I just wanted to inform 
Shiragami-san of something.

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:18.130
Inform me?

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.540
It's finally complete.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.960
My Russian Cream Puff Z!

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.960
<b>Russian Cream Puff Z</b>

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:24.590
Really?!

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.050
<i>This is the worst thing that could happen!</i>

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:29.540
<i>What are you even doing 
in the middle of work?</i>

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.770
<i>Russian cream puffs would 
totally expose her secret!</i>

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:36.050
<i>It was because of the Russian cream 
puffs that the class rep found out.</i>

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:39.360
<i>And awful things happened in that 
sexy battle with the principal, too.</i>

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.110
<i>We've made it through so many tight spots.</i>

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.530
<i>I can't let her secret get out now!</i>

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:48.160
F-Fine! I'll eat all of your cream puffs!

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.370
What? Why the big reaction?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.210
Oh, screw it all!

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:54.200
Where are the cream puffs, Mikan?!

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:56.540
They're right here.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.790
Are you trying to kill me?!

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.780
K-Kuromine-kun, you shouldn't...

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.250
What's with the cream puffs?

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:04.760
They look good, Asahi.

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:06.460
Y-You guys...

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.720
Shiragami-san...

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:14.900
Listen, um... Tell Asahi that 
if anything nasty happens,

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.480
we can at least help him out a little.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:21.730
Asahi's acting weird for your 
sake, right, Shiragami-san?

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.530
He's generally good for nothing,

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.740
but I don't dislike seeing him 
actually try once in a while.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.110
I wouldn't mind rooting for him, I guess.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.430
We're his friends, after all.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:35.200
All right, go ahead and eat them!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.840
I-I tell him he doesn't have to 
try so hard, but he does anyway.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:45.740
Kuromine-kun really is impossible...

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:49.970
And, well... I don't dislike that about him.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:52.480
That's why...

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:57.100
I really want Kuromine-kun to 
find happiness with Aizawa-san!

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:59.100
<i>I get it.</i>

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.300
<i>She's so dense, and Asahi's good for nothing.</i>

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:05.550
<i>That's what keeps these two 
in such perfect balance.</i>

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:13.000
I must admit, I've created
something truly horrific.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:20.250
<i>I have a great idea.</i>

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.760
Newspaper Club

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:27.160
President...

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:28.960
They're gone! They're gone! 
They're gone! They're gone!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.310
What's the matter?

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.470
They're gone!

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:35.390
Wh-What the heck?

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.220
<i>Where did they go?</i>

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.340
<i>My...</i>

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.690
It's Akemi-san.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:42.690
Hello.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.720
M-Mikan! I haven't forgotten yesterday's—

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.020
Never mind that!

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:50.690
Huh? You lost your glasses?

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:51.960
That's not good.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:53.900
You can't see without your glasses, can you?

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.030
We'd better find them quick.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.520
Shiragami, that won't be a problem.

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.030
They're fake glasses.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:00.290
Huh? They are?

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:03.690
Well, yeah, but...

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.400
I just don't really feel right without them.

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.250
Like, I can't get into heathen mode.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:13.320
M-Maybe we don't need to find your glasses.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:15.330
Hey, Kuromine-kun.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:21.030
Well, heathen mode is one thing,

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.190
but those glasses are...

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.920
F-Forget it!

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:28.980
It's fine!

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:31.780
I'll find them myself!

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.360
M-Mikan?

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.380
<i>I can't tell them...</i>

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:40.740
<i>about that.</i>

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.250
They're not here.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.250
They're not here.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.870
Sh-Shishido-san!

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:54.050
You're wearing a surprisingly cute pair.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.880
Mind your own business!

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:58.220
Where'd they go, though?

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.580
Are you looking for something, too?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.930
Yeah, I can't find my panties.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:05.690
Don't lose those!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.940
Oh well, I guess I don't need them.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:08.690
See you.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:09.980
Yes, you do!

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.560
There you are.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.280
Wh-What do you want, Aizawa-san?

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.120
Akemi Mikan.

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:19.000
I'm in your debt.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:19.620
Huh?

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:25.960
You made a full-page article about 
when I rejected Kuromine, didn't you?

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:28.990
Sorry about that.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.770
Sh-She apologized?

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.210
<i>The</i> Heathen Queen?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.230
Even I apologize, once in a while.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:39.340
So, seriously, what do you want, Aizawa-san?

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:43.850
I heard from Shiragami 
Youko and Kuromine Asahi.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:44.720
Huh?

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:47.130
So I thought I'd help out, too.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.730
You "too"?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:51.900
So they are, too?

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:52.770
Obviously.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.840
I think Mikan's pretty upset.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:58.530
Apparently those glasses are 
really important to her.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:03.620
<i>These two have gone through so much at 
the hands of Akemi Mikan, and yet they...</i>

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:05.580
All right.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.540
I'll help.

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:08.000
Thank you.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.790
Let's split up and look for them.

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:14.300
Thanks.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:15.250
Yeah.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:19.810
You know, it's kind of creepy when 
you're so honest about what you feel.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:21.840
Okay, fine, fine.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:24.260
Hurry up and find my glasses 
so I can go back to—

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.200
What is it, Akemi Mikan?

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:32.480
Th-The horned girl?!

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:37.070
<b>Where'd my panties go?</b>

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:37.070
<b>Eromine-kun?!</b>

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.740
Th-The horned girl.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.980
What do you want from us?

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:43.890
What are you plotting to do this time?

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:44.790
Wait, look!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.020
She has my glasses!

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:48.000
What?

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:49.830
After her!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:50.290
Right!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:59.910
Aizawa-san, you're not going to tell me 
not to run in the hallways now, are you?

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:02.730
I'll apologize to the teachers later.

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:03.430
That's it!

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.130
<i>The Heathen Queen and the Iron Lady, huh?</i>

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:09.430
<i>Messing with them is going to be fun.</i>

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.700
Move! out of my way!

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:14.120
Was that the principal?

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:14.690
Asahi!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.690
The horned girl has my glasses!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.280
What?!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:24.640
<i>And the leaky basket joins them.</i>

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:26.870
<i>This just gets better and better.</i>

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.330
Can you guess which pair is the real one?

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:36.340
What the?

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.450
Hey, don't throw my glasses!

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.420
How can she perform such a trick?

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:43.590
Is she actually a devil?!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.680
Whoa! Stay inside!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.470
Now, which pair is the real one?

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:52.960
How will we ever know which pair is yours?

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.440
I think they each have different designs.

00:11:56.810 --> 00:12:00.240
Actually, she's still wearing Mikan's glasses.

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.740
You noticed. Well done!

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:07.380
She's totally crying sour grapes, isn't she?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.060
But how about this?

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:16.840
Is she truly a devil?

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:20.080
Only one of them is wearing glasses...

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:22.420
In that case...

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:30.100
N-Now they're all the same design?

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:34.940
Did you really think I wouldn't 
have thought of that?

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:38.150
No, you totally only noticed 
after Asahi pointed it out.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:40.430
You shouldn't have told her!

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:41.510
Sorry.

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:42.950
Hey!

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.540
<i>Is that all the Heathen Queen has got?</i>

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:50.450
<i>It seems I'm leaps and bounds ahead of her.</i>

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:54.370
<i>For a devil like me, you're all just—</i>

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:58.960
Principal, you seem to be having a lot of fun.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:00.960
A-Akari.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.420
I want each and every one 
of you in this classroom.

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:07.430
Each and every one, immediately.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.540
Akari! No, it's not like that!

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:13.180
These glasses... These glasses are...

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:21.910
Now's your chance, Akemi Mikan.

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:28.490
They seem intact. Is that the real pair?

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:31.490
Yeah, I think so.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:33.750
Thank goodness.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:36.250
I'll go let Shiragami know.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.770
They must be very precious to you.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:44.300
It really is creepy when you're that 
honest about what you feel, though.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.330
Shut up!

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.040
I'll go right back to normal.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.670
Don't, Mikan-san.

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:50.960
Take this opportunity to become honest.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:51.560
Hey!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:52.180
Ow, ow.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.720
Who are you talking to?

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.770
What are you talking about, Aizawa-san?

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.350
No one's here besides us!

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.260
But I just heard a voice.

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.790
You're imagining things.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:03.560
But...

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.530
Yes, it's just your imagination.

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:19.050
Actually, I am Fuku-chan, 
a fukunokami trainee

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:22.450
who has inhabited these glasses 
to help reform Mikan-chan.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.090
F-Fukunokami?

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:28.520
It's possessing my glasses for some reason.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:29.430
It's an evil spirit.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.430
How dare you call me an evil spirit?

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.010
I'm a god of fortune.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:36.320
A god of fortune? You're a god?

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:37.120
Yes.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:41.690
We fukunokami are gods who inhabit 
long-cared-for belongings to bring fortune.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:42.690
You're just a trainee.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:46.030
I don't see any speakers or anything.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:51.120
Aizawa-san, you don't know of any shrines 
around here that exorcise evil spirits, do you?

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.140
I told you, I'm not an evil spirit!

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.600
I'm a fukunokami!

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:58.620
It's a little hard to believe, though.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.880
Is there any way to prove you're a fukunokami?

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.030
Yeah!

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:06.160
If you're really a fukunokami 
trainee, then prove it.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.800
I guess I have no choice.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.640
All right, then, look at your feet.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:13.800
My feet?

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:18.400
It's a four-leaf clover.

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:21.720
There are clovers all around here. 
Of course there'd be at least one.

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.730
It had already exercised its powers?

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:28.660
S-Sorry, could you show us again?

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:30.460
Fine, then.

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:33.420
I'll show you something even more lucky.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.740
Let's see...

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.910
Look on the other side of the river.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.660
There's a rainbow, even though it's not raining.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.670
How's that? Amazing, right?

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:46.670
Again, you didn't do that.
It's just a coincidence.

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:48.730
You still doubt me?

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:51.550
Mikan-san, you really do have a corrupt mind.

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.000
Very well.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:58.970
I'll remind you of when you had a 
pure heart, by force if I have to.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.090
Indeed!

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:05.190
You used to believe you could 
transform into a magical girl.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:07.940
How far back in my history are you digging?!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.190
I see.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.720
You went through that phase too, huh?

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:13.370
Wh-When I was a kid, sure.

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:16.450
Seriously, how do you know about that?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.910
It wasn't until I was in high school 
that you possessed my glasses.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.210
It was recently that I inhabited them,

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:25.460
but I inherited the memories 
of these glasses, too.

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.590
There you go, kid. Your prize.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.090
G-Glasses?

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:36.010
Hey, Asahi, if you don't want 
those, can I have them?

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.560
Oh, sure, I guess.

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:45.530
I'm trashing them!

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.600
I'm trashing them before they say too much!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.770
C-Calm down, Akemi Mikan!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:50.840
Are you sane?

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:54.110
You would throw away glasses that hold 
such memories in an emotional fit?

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:55.880
Memories?

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.440
Yeah, exactly.

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:59.970
A fukunokami like me would 
never have inhabited them if

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:01.230
she hadn't treasured them deeply.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:03.380
You're already saying too much!

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:05.330
It's all because Asahi gave you—

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:10.180
M-Man, these glasses say the weirdest things.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:15.600
The thing is, Aizawa-san, 
my family doesn't have much money.

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:17.760
I just took care of them because 
it'd be wasteful not to.

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:20.180
Oh, please! Remember what you used to say?

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.850
"I'm going to marry Asahi-kun."

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.650
When I was a kid, sure!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.750
<i>The fukunokami are formidable indeed.</i>

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.240
<i>It's overwhelmed Akemi Mikan.</i>

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:38.740
<i>And more than that, it shows 
no sign of bringing good luck.</i>

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.250
<i>But now I get it.</i>

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.750
<i>Akemi Mikan, you...</i>

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:48.750
<i>You like Kuromine Asahi, too?</i>

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:54.720
<i>W-Wait! What do you mean 
by "too," Aizawa Nagisa?!</i>

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.400
<i>I-It's not as if I...</i>

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:57.760
Aizawa-san,

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:01.230
I don't know if you'll believe me or not,

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.890
but it's really not like that.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:06.070
I mean... I'll admit it.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.890
I'll admit there was a time when I liked Asahi.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:13.280
But it's not as if anything actually happened.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.840
It's not like that anymore.

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:19.200
He's just a friend from way back.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.240
You're still not going to be honest?

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.200
You're still not going to go 
back to how you used to be?

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.330
Shut up, you god of misfortune!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:28.400
G-God of misfortune?

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:31.540
It's going to take the power 
of love to make you reform.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.360
Power of love?

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:35.130
You sound as sketchy as ever.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.670
Hey, Mikan!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:38.760
What are you doing there?

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:43.010
Well, Mikan-san, lucky you.
Now you see that I'm a real—

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.880
Asahi has to come <i>now</i>?

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:46.900
You're seriously a god of 
misfortune, aren't you?!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.690
Don't be rash, Akemi Mikan!

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.870
I have to put on my glasses 
and go into heathen mode.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:52.940
Oh, no, you won't!

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:55.510
If you put on these glasses 
in front of Asahi-kun,

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:58.240
I'll confess to him for you!

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:00.550
Confess? What do you mean?!

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.610
I don't have any feelings for him anymore...

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:03.840
Mikan-san!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.690
If you really don't like him or anything,

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:10.120
you should be able to face 
him without your glasses!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:18.000
A-Akemi Mikan,

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.970
what are you going to do 
about the fukunokami?

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.560
I can't tell them, obviously.

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:25.100
How am I supposed to explain this?

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:26.400
Akemi-san.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.670
I'm glad you found your glasses.

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:29.680
Yeah.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.490
I heard you helped look for them.

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:32.440
Thanks.

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:35.580
You finally found them. 
Aren't you going to put them on?

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:37.690
O-Oh, well...

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:40.200
What's wrong, Mikan?

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:41.870
<i>Crap...</i>

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:43.830
<i>I'm getting overly conscious because of</i>

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.740
<i>that stuff we were just talking about.</i>

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:48.540
<i>I can't take it anymore!</i>

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:51.040
Asahi-kun! Actually, I'm...

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.970
<i>She's fighting.</i>

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:58.530
<i>Akemi Mikan is fighting with all she has.</i>

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:01.300
<i>I want to help her somehow.</i>

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:04.120
<i>I'll at least distract those two.</i>

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.730
<i>Aizawa-san, what are you doing?</i>

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:13.060
<i>Class Rep, what are you—</i>

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:14.970
<i>And Shiragami! Your wings!</i>

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:16.310
<i>You're getting lax lately!</i>

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:21.740
<i>I must take their attention away 
from Akemi Mikan somehow.</i>

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:25.410
<i>I have to try to take Akemi-san's 
attention off of Aizawa-san.</i>

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:29.330
<i>I have to try to take Mikan's attention 
away from Shiragami and Class Rep.</i>

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:34.460
What the hell?!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.290
That's freaky! And creepy!

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:40.300
<i>She's distracted, but not in a good way.</i>

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:43.190
What's even going on?

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:44.010
Aizawa-san!

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.720
D-Don't!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.320
Your fangs, too!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:52.060
What's up with you guys anyway?!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.940
<i>Whoa, he's close...</i>

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:55.940
<i>What is this?</i>

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.810
<i>I can't take it anymore.</i>

00:20:58.570 --> 00:20:59.860
You mustn't, Mikan-san!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.240
I'll confess if you put me on!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.320
N-No!

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.490
That was a close call.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.870
A-Aizawa-san...

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.650
Shiragami, your wings.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.810
Akemi Mikan, you're safe now.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:22.560
Asahi-kun!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.590
Actually, I am...

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.320
in love with you!

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:30.970
Wait... Huh?

00:23:21.890 --> 00:23:23.120
Quiz Fukuonaire!

00:23:23.120 --> 00:23:24.550
I'm your host, Fuku Monta.

00:23:24.550 --> 00:23:26.210
You shut up already!

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:31.330
Question: who in this picture is 
wearing the same glasses as Mikan-san?

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:32.860
How would I know?

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:35.290
Then let's use the fifty-fifty.

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:37.360
That's not what you take the "half" from!

00:23:37.360 --> 00:23:38.530
My mistake.

00:23:38.530 --> 00:23:42.430
But seeing Asahi-kun naked
is lucky for you, isn't it?

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:43.920
Thanks to the god of fortune trainee—

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:47.330
Th-Th-That doesn't make me happy!

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.990
<b>Next Episode:
"Let's Go to the Summer Festival!"</b>

00:23:47.330 --> 00:23:50.540
I'll break! You're going to break me!
